  "notes": "Single source of truth for the bounded DSV4 PP8 resident production envelope. Materialized topology/runtime/KV JSON files must match this file. This profile is first-three co-resident survival mode after live Qwen+Gemma+DSV4 startup at 4 seqs/2048 tokens/1GiB KV loaded successfully but drove spark2 below the 10% available-RAM floor, and after a 2 seqs/1024 tokens/512MiB KV launch exposed first-run FlashInfer/CUDA compiler RAM pressure on sparks 4-6. It caps DSV4 at 2 active sequences, 1024 batched tokens, 512MiB resident/offload KV per rank, 0.08 GPU utilization, balances DSV4 layers as 4/5/5/6/6/6/6/5, skips the SM121 DeepGEMM pre-JIT warmup that can hit gemm.hpp:99 before serving, and requires a DSV4-only warmup before all-three residency."
